itle_workLabelAuthor__Kxy5E">／<div class="partialGiftWidgetActivityName ActivityName_inlineBlock__7Azkl"><a href="/users/o_kappa" class="LinkAppearance_link__POVTP LinkAppearance_hoverblueWithUnderline__y_22T">岡野かっぱ</a></div></span></h3><div><a href="/works/2912051606099862482" class="LinkAppearance_link__POVTP"><div class="Typography_fontSize-1s__9qDLP Typography_color-gray__ObCRz Typography_lineHeight-1s__3iKaG"><span class="TruncateMultipleLines_span__TsOLJ" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">
